Occupancy check: for each resource in closureResources (sorted): lockResource(resource, now); then listOccupying(resource, now) → any lease with incidentId != incident.id() → 422 with details {resourceKey, occupyingIncidentKey}. Need incident key from incidentId → add IncidentRepository.findById.

Wait — occupancy includes the closure's own leases (same incident) — filter to other incidents.

Per-item validations (all before writes):
