- renewer != lease.assignedBy else 422 "续期人必须不同于原分配人".
- newVersion > lease.authVersion else 422 details {currentVersion, requestedVersion}.
- newExpiresAt > now else 422 details {renewedAt: now, newExpiresAt}.

Then apply all: renewLease(lease.id, newVersion, newExpiresAt, now); insertEvent(RENEW, oldVersion, newVersion, actor, now, null). Build RenewedLeaseView with extensionSeconds = between(oldExpiresAt, newExpiresAt).

